lue\" is the single-target field; pairing it\n    # with \"end\" leaves only a single value, which the Garmin export turns\n    # into an HR zone number, so the watch shows its own zone band instead.\n    return {\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"start\": lo, \"end\": hi}''')\nopen('gen.py','w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json | grep -A4 '\"hr\"' | head -12; git diff --stat"}}}
